Koo-to no kisetsu nanoni kanchigai shiteru

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:58.390
Koo-to no kisetsu nanoni kanchigai shiteru

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:02.629
Doushite nano?

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:06.599
Konna ureshikute

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:14.404
Chigiresouna hodo waratte iru noni

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:22.949
Kare no senaka mite wa mune tsumaru

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:30.913
Taenai egao no utsu no naka de

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.592
Come on, not again! Damn it!

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:42.965
And I'm completely broke too.

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:49.676
Episode #1 4
Reason to Fight
Good morning, Rachel.

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:52.270
Episode #1 4
Reason to Fight

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:58.847
I know Rachel is still mad at me.

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:00.886
Huh?

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:04.514
I said "good morning" o her this morning,
but she ignored me.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:07.590
Oh, I see.

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:11.860
I know I really have to do better.

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:15.233
I need to exercise and be strong.

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:20.903
I need to learn how to fight well enough
so that even Rachel will approve of me.

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:24.267
Yeah, if you try hard enough everyone will see it.

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:26.101
Let's practice together again, okay.

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:28.414
Are you sure?

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:30.950
Of course, how about tonight?

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:33.553
Sure, I can go after putting my
brother and sister to bed.

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:34.884
It's decided then!

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:40.459
What are you looking at?

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:41.761
Nothing.

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:44.931
Wow, Rachel, your arms are so toned!

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:46.299
Not really.

00:02:46.299 --> 00:02:47.066
Let me see!

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:47.433
Come on, stop it.
Let me see!

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:48.234
Come on, stop it.

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:49.565
You been working out or what?

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:51.604
I'm not doing anything.

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:53.037
Come on, you'll be late for class.

00:02:53.273 --> 00:02:54.672
Hey, wait!

00:02:58.111 --> 00:02:59.840
Whoa! Grace chick!

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:01.748
Are you late?

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:05.479
My car broke down on me again.
Just pretend that you didn't see me, okay?

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:07.654
Claire...

00:03:07.654 --> 00:03:10.316
Hey, more importantly, you figured
out something, right?

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.591
Huh?

00:03:11.591 --> 00:03:13.218
I'm talking about how you move your body.

00:03:14.127 --> 00:03:15.389
You know, during the fight.

00:03:16.095 --> 00:03:17.892
I noticed a difference in you the other day.

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:19.288
Right...

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:21.466
I saw you floating up in the air.

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:23.670
Yeah, just a little.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:24.728
So you figured out how?

00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:29.642
I'm not very sure yet, but as long as
you can control your strength,

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:31.010
I think you can execute it when you want to.

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.136
Seriously?

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:35.910
I still don't know exactly how to explain it, but...

00:03:36.149 --> 00:03:37.784
Show me how you do it next time.

00:03:37.784 --> 00:03:40.353
I'm supposed to meet up with Rose tonight.
You wanna come too?

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:44.722
Damn, I need to make some money to
get my car fixed, you know.

00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:48.728
Well, that's the deal with me,
so I'll catch you guys next time.

00:03:48.728 --> 00:03:49.854
Okay.

00:03:56.569 --> 00:03:57.637
Luke!

00:03:57.637 --> 00:03:58.438
Hey, Amanda.

00:03:58.438 --> 00:04:00.133
Take a look at that!

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:01.441
Sam is losing again!

00:04:01.441 --> 00:04:02.669
I got it!
Sam is losing again!

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:06.713
Not even close!

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:08.548
I think I won this game!

00:04:08.548 --> 00:04:10.416
Sam, let me try it next time.

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:13.453
No, you can't, Luke! If he loses, he pays our tab!

00:04:13.453 --> 00:04:14.153
Oh, I get it.

00:04:14.153 --> 00:04:14.454
To be more precise,
men have to cover girls' tabs.
Oh, I get it.

00:04:14.454 --> 00:04:16.322
To be more precise,
men have to cover girls' tabs.

00:04:16.322 --> 00:04:17.890
Hey, that's bullshit!

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.892
Come on, just let me see that!

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:21.450
I'm next!

00:04:36.743 --> 00:04:37.971
Kate!

00:04:38.678 --> 00:04:41.545
Jeez, I don't get it!

00:04:57.297 --> 00:04:59.197
Is it because the cat showed up?

00:04:59.832 --> 00:05:02.699
And I jumped last time when you
showed up all of a sudden too!

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:05.661
I think I figured it out a little bit.

00:05:06.105 --> 00:05:07.094
What?

00:05:19.085 --> 00:05:20.787
I can't do it like I want to.

00:05:20.787 --> 00:05:23.187
I can't even feel like I'm going to float.

00:05:26.592 --> 00:05:29.729
Excuse me, Miss, can I get an
extra-large cheeseburger?

00:05:29.729 --> 00:05:32.765
Okay! One extra-large cheeseburger!

00:05:32.765 --> 00:05:34.027
Got it!

00:05:35.168 --> 00:05:36.396
I knew it...

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.839
I was just wondering who the hell would eat that
jumbo burger in the middle of the night.

00:05:39.839 --> 00:05:43.002
I don't think that's the way
to talk to your customer.

00:05:46.179 --> 00:05:47.180
Really?

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.081
Yeah.

00:05:48.081 --> 00:05:48.981
Why?

00:05:48.981 --> 00:05:51.245
"Why"? Because I am.

00:05:51.484 --> 00:05:53.186
No, that's not what I meant.

00:05:53.186 --> 00:05:55.855
So, you're married, but why are you
out this late at night?

00:05:55.855 --> 00:05:57.290
Lounging around like this, you mean?

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:58.925
Yeah, I'm very curious.

00:05:58.925 --> 00:06:01.120
My wife writes novels.

00:06:01.527 --> 00:06:02.528
Novels?

00:06:02.528 --> 00:06:06.132
Yup, the book is in the homestretch and
it looked like she wanted to focus,

00:06:06.132 --> 00:06:08.101
so I'm killing time outside the house.

00:06:08.101 --> 00:06:09.500
Oh, I see...

00:06:09.702 --> 00:06:12.637
Well, to put it bluntly, we've got a small place.

00:06:13.573 --> 00:06:16.064
But actually, this isn't too bad.

00:06:16.309 --> 00:06:19.210
I get to go to the bookstores late at
night and have some coffee.

00:06:19.412 --> 00:06:21.147
And see one of your students too.

00:06:21.147 --> 00:06:23.383
I guess that might not fly, huh?

00:06:23.383 --> 00:06:26.819
But we just ran into each other by accident,
so I don't see any problem with that.

00:06:26.819 --> 00:06:29.720
Yeah, I'm just gonna ask the school president
what she thinks about that.

00:06:31.324 --> 00:06:32.458
Just kidding.

00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:33.652
There's no way I'd do that.

00:06:47.774 --> 00:06:49.173
I got it.

00:07:07.059 --> 00:07:08.227
See you guys later.

00:07:08.227 --> 00:07:09.251
Okay.
See you later.

00:07:10.496 --> 00:07:11.664
See you later.

00:07:11.664 --> 00:07:12.858
Bye.

00:07:17.069 --> 00:07:19.338
I don't see any changes in her though.

00:07:19.338 --> 00:07:20.239
I know...

00:07:20.239 --> 00:07:22.275
And when I asked her, she just said,
"It's nothing."

00:07:22.275 --> 00:07:24.110
It can't be just nothing!

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:25.678
She's been late for school and skipping classes.

00:07:25.678 --> 00:07:30.547
Right, but she might just be emotionally
unstable since Lise died.

00:07:31.584 --> 00:07:34.754
Well, I guess I'll just go have a talk
with the school president.

00:07:34.754 --> 00:07:35.788
Hey, Dad.

00:07:35.788 --> 00:07:36.722
Hmm?

00:07:36.722 --> 00:07:41.627
If you go, it'll look like this is a big deal,
so why don't I go see them first?

00:07:41.627 --> 00:07:42.528
You?

00:07:42.528 --> 00:07:46.464
Yeah, since I'm a former student and
I know the school president.

00:07:47.166 --> 00:07:48.935
But...

00:07:48.935 --> 00:07:50.994
It'll be fine, I can handle it.

00:07:59.979 --> 00:08:00.946
Stop the car.

00:08:09.722 --> 00:08:11.713
Oh, yeah, I was supposed to go
to my friend's birthday party.

00:08:12.158 --> 00:08:14.991
At a Japanese restaurant called
Nori Next Door!

00:08:15.461 --> 00:08:17.486
We should go check it out together next time.

00:08:21.634 --> 00:08:29.408
Well, we feel that a certain amount of instability
is only natural, since she lost her friend Lise.

00:08:29.408 --> 00:08:35.147
Yes, personally I'm not too worried,
but my father has such...

00:08:35.147 --> 00:08:36.716
High expectations of Kate?

00:08:36.716 --> 00:08:37.350
Right.

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:37.884
I don't see why he wouldn't.
Right.

00:08:37.884 --> 00:08:38.985
I don't see why he wouldn't.

00:08:38.985 --> 00:08:44.013
There's only one other girl in the same grade
who's been selected as a member of Grace.

00:08:44.457 --> 00:08:50.327
Why don't we give her a little more time
and just be supportive of her?

00:08:50.396 --> 00:08:51.864
Yes...

00:08:51.864 --> 00:08:54.230
This is the head of Grace, Paula.

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:57.069
I'm Paula Sinclair, nice to meet you.

00:08:57.069 --> 00:09:04.176
I'm planning to have her to talk to Kate more
often and do Grace activities with her.

00:09:04.176 --> 00:09:07.213
Okay, thank you for everything.

00:09:07.213 --> 00:09:08.373
Good.

00:09:08.681 --> 00:09:10.716
Is he also a graduate of our school?

00:09:10.716 --> 00:09:14.487
No, I... My name is Emilio.

00:09:14.487 --> 00:09:17.056
Actually, he says this is his first time
to even come to Roosevelt Island.

00:09:17.056 --> 00:09:21.755
Is that so? What do you think of the school?

00:09:22.695 --> 00:09:25.498
It's surrounded by nature.
I think it's a wonderful place.

00:09:25.498 --> 00:09:27.800
It's away from the hustle and
bustle of the city too.

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:31.203
If you have time, why don't you show
him around in the school property?

00:09:31.203 --> 00:09:32.500
Thank you so much.

00:09:35.775 --> 00:09:39.178
Auntie, I can't take this much longer.

00:09:39.178 --> 00:09:39.745
What?

00:09:39.745 --> 00:09:40.346
How relieved would I feel if only I could
tell Kate that I know everything?
What?

00:09:40.346 --> 00:09:43.783
How relieved would I feel if only I could
tell Kate that I know everything?

00:09:43.783 --> 00:09:46.152
I've already told you not to do that.

00:09:46.152 --> 00:09:46.953
But...

00:09:46.953 --> 00:09:50.787
You're not in her shoes, and I don't
want you to ever forget that.

00:09:51.424 --> 00:09:53.915
You might feel better afterwards,
but what about Kate?

00:09:55.494 --> 00:09:57.797
Don't you think that would make
her suffer even more?

00:09:57.797 --> 00:10:00.366
I understand what it's like because
I was in the same situation once.

00:10:00.366 --> 00:10:01.267
Right.

00:10:01.267 --> 00:10:07.866
I understand this isn't easy, but you're the only
one in this school who can protect those girls.

00:10:08.307 --> 00:10:09.433
Yes.

00:10:11.377 --> 00:10:12.674
Where's Kate's sister?

00:10:12.878 --> 00:10:15.745
I think she's still on the school property.

00:10:16.082 --> 00:10:17.413
I see.

00:10:17.583 --> 00:10:20.279
Kate will be okay, right?

00:10:20.786 --> 00:10:22.447
She'll be okay for a long time, right?

00:10:22.955 --> 00:10:24.547
All we can do is to have faith in her.

00:10:24.924 --> 00:10:27.518
Our enemy will soon have no women.
That is everything.

00:10:27.994 --> 00:10:31.130
And when that happens, they may make a move;

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:35.464
a move more drastic than we've
ever experienced before.

00:10:36.068 --> 00:10:41.005
Paula, I know it's hard, but please watch
what's happening inside the school.

00:10:41.607 --> 00:10:43.165
Yes, Auntie.

00:10:43.509 --> 00:10:45.739
You're supposed to call me "President"
at school, remember?

00:10:48.014 --> 00:10:50.005
What's the matter? Are you okay?

00:10:50.383 --> 00:10:51.680
Yeah...

00:10:51.984 --> 00:10:53.952
I don't know why, but I just felt
stuffy all of a sudden.

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:55.953
Oh, you're pitiful!

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:58.414
Kate!

00:10:59.425 --> 00:11:01.527
Thank you for coming today.

00:11:01.527 --> 00:11:04.894
No problem, this has been a new
experience for me somehow.

00:11:05.498 --> 00:11:08.296
The president said she's not
particularly worried about you.

00:11:08.801 --> 00:11:09.802
Okay.

00:11:09.802 --> 00:11:11.337
I'll talk to Dad and it'll be fine.

00:11:11.337 --> 00:11:12.497
Thanks.

00:11:12.772 --> 00:11:15.808
By the way, how has it going
with Herve since then?

00:11:15.808 --> 00:11:17.777
Well, that's...

00:11:17.777 --> 00:11:19.578
What, you guys are fighting or something?

00:11:19.578 --> 00:11:21.847
No, that's not it, but...

00:11:21.847 --> 00:11:23.109
But what?

00:11:24.383 --> 00:11:25.543
Well...

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:29.647
Let's get this data processed right away.

00:11:30.056 --> 00:11:31.114
Okay.

00:11:36.629 --> 00:11:37.663
Mireille...

00:11:37.663 --> 00:11:40.366
Anna, Herve...

00:11:40.366 --> 00:11:42.732
You look good today.

00:11:43.335 --> 00:11:44.403
Yeah...

00:11:44.403 --> 00:11:47.338
You'll get better soon, Mireille.

00:11:47.807 --> 00:11:48.974
Yeah...

00:11:48.974 --> 00:11:51.943
And when you do, we're gonna go
outside and hang out!

00:11:52.845 --> 00:11:53.903
Yeah...

00:11:57.316 --> 00:11:59.876
We'll definitely do that.

00:12:07.493 --> 00:12:08.761
How long ago was it?

00:12:08.761 --> 00:12:09.562
What?

00:12:09.562 --> 00:12:09.929
When was the last time you went
inside that building?
What?

00:12:09.929 --> 00:12:11.521
When was the last time you went
inside that building?

00:12:12.832 --> 00:12:14.697
I hadn't been there since I was a kid.

00:12:15.134 --> 00:12:16.192
I see.

00:12:16.569 --> 00:12:20.232
Regular blood tests; the last time I went
there was when I was twelve.

00:12:20.806 --> 00:12:24.606
They gave me a blue sticker and told me to
come back again when I turned twenty.

00:12:25.144 --> 00:12:27.806
But I never went back when I turned twenty.

00:12:28.214 --> 00:12:29.381
Why not?

00:12:29.381 --> 00:12:33.044
All of the sudden, I started worrying about
what they might tell me at the test.

00:12:33.986 --> 00:12:36.580
My friend and I decided to drive all
the way to the West Coast by car.

00:12:36.989 --> 00:12:38.457
But in the end, we gave up and turned back.

00:12:38.457 --> 00:12:42.257
That was after we drove through Texas and
right when we entered New Mexico.

00:12:42.762 --> 00:12:43.888
I see.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:45.931
The blue sticker is...

00:12:45.931 --> 00:12:49.731
I already know. The blue one means you're
pretty much okay when you're a teenager, right?

00:12:49.902 --> 00:12:50.803
Right.

00:12:50.803 --> 00:12:53.405
My friend told me about it much later.

00:12:53.405 --> 00:12:54.340
I see.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:58.333
He got a red sticker and died at age seventeen.

00:13:00.446 --> 00:13:04.746
I heard that you cut a date short by
telling her a lie the other day.

00:13:05.651 --> 00:13:07.516
She already knew that you lied to her.

00:13:08.053 --> 00:13:09.350
She did, huh?

00:13:10.089 --> 00:13:11.624
Was that something to do with Mireille?

00:13:11.624 --> 00:13:12.682
Yeah.

00:13:13.726 --> 00:13:17.526
Birthday party... I'll come up with
a better lie next time.

00:13:18.564 --> 00:13:20.725
How's Mireille doing?

00:13:22.935 --> 00:13:24.095
I see...

00:13:28.908 --> 00:13:31.103
He just bowed to him, didn't he?

00:13:31.277 --> 00:13:34.644
I checked the staff list,
but I couldn't find his name.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:36.015
Is he the son of the owner?

00:13:36.015 --> 00:13:39.385
Actually, we're looking into the connection
between him and the company right now,

00:13:39.385 --> 00:13:41.444
but we haven't found out anything
from their official records.

00:13:41.587 --> 00:13:45.491
I see... But this is a legit business, right?

00:13:45.491 --> 00:13:47.982
Yeah, it's a top-ranking company.

00:13:50.029 --> 00:13:53.795
Hello? Thanks, we're on our way there,
but the traffic is kind of bad.

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:57.597
We should be able to get
there in twenty minutes.

00:13:58.204 --> 00:14:01.298
Yes! Yes! We are in a hurry.

00:14:03.242 --> 00:14:04.243
Was that the chief?

00:14:04.243 --> 00:14:06.609
Yes, he told me to hurry up and go to the site.

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:14.544
Looks like you have to get a few new parts.

00:14:14.987 --> 00:14:16.420
This is what happens when you don't
do maintenance on your car.

00:14:17.590 --> 00:14:19.148
How much do you think it will cost me?

00:14:19.491 --> 00:14:23.329
Don't worry, I'll negotiate with them so
you won't have to break the bank.

00:14:23.329 --> 00:14:24.387
Thanks.

00:14:24.964 --> 00:14:27.330
Besides, I have to pay back my brother.

00:14:27.499 --> 00:14:28.567
So, you can pay back!

00:14:28.567 --> 00:14:32.171
Just a little though, but I haven't been
able to get a hold of him yet.

00:14:32.171 --> 00:14:33.195
I see.

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:36.008
I'm kind of worried now.

00:14:36.008 --> 00:14:37.441
Why would you be so worried about him?

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:41.874
‘Cause he always depends on my father,
and I can't stand to watch it.

00:14:42.381 --> 00:14:45.714
It's like, he has no clue that my father
isn't that easy to walk all over.

00:14:48.153 --> 00:14:50.917
Who knows, he might eventually get dumped by
my father one day and end up on the street.

00:14:51.423 --> 00:14:53.857
But would he do that to his own child?

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:57.320
You just don't know my father.

00:15:02.067 --> 00:15:03.967
Hey, when will it be fixed?

00:15:12.778 --> 00:15:16.315
Yes, we've heard that everything's
been going smoothly

00:15:16.315 --> 00:15:20.183
with the purchase in Paris.
Yes, we're sorry to worry you.

00:15:20.519 --> 00:15:22.254
As soon as he returns, we'll make
sure that he visits you,

